  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint: \r\nLet $p=x+i y, p^{2}=\\left(x^{2}-y^{2}\\right)+2 i x y, p^{4}=\\left(x^{2}-y^{2}\\right)^{2}-4 x^{2} y^{2}+4 i x y\\left(x^{2}-y^{2}\\right)$\r\nNow, $x y\\left(x^{2}-y^{2}\\right)=0, \\quad x=\\pm y \\Rightarrow y^{2}=\\frac{1}{2} \\Rightarrow y=\\pm \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$\r\nFour complex numbers.",
